TEXT 704 672 Left 1 ;SIM02  Output voltage network (calculation C3)  [DS1 p.8 Table 2, p.10 Fig.19]
TEXT 704 704 Left 1 ;VNI = 7.15 x 3.3/(4.7+3.3) = 2.95 V ;  VOUT = VNI x (1 + RPOT/RLO)
